keywords An Imp's Request, Hot and Itchy, The Wrong Stuff, Trolls of a Feather, Impsy, Felcloth, Rotting Wood, Bloodvenom Essence, Withered Protector, Irontree, Tainted Ooze, Voodoo Feather, Sunken Temple, Temple of Atal'Hakkar, Gasher, Zul'Lor, Hukku, Mijan, Zolo, Loro, Soul Harvester, Abyss Shard, Robes of Servitude, Warlock, class quest
